{"page":379,"width":1663,"height":2342,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"큐에서 Cß 꺼내서 방문하고 띠 인접 정침","words":[{"text":"큐에서","x":888,"y":466,"width":52,"height":23},{"text":"Cß","x":953,"y":467,"width":28,"height":22},{"text":"꺼내서","x":993,"y":466,"width":52,"height":23},{"text":"방문하고","x":1057,"y":466,"width":71,"height":23},{"text":"띠","x":1141,"y":464,"width":28,"height":23},{"text":"인접","x":1182,"y":464,"width":36,"height":24},{"text":"정침","x":1231,"y":463,"width":35,"height":25}]},{"text":"듬을 큐에 추가한다.","words":[{"text":"듬을","x":889,"y":501,"width":34,"height":23},{"text":"큐에","x":934,"y":501,"width":34,"height":22},{"text":"추가한다.","x":980,"y":500,"width":80,"height":24}]},{"text":"큐에서 Eß 꺼내서 방문하고 인접 정꼬 는","words":[{"text":"큐에서","x":884,"y":922,"width":51,"height":23},{"text":"Eß","x":946,"y":923,"width":27,"height":21},{"text":"꺼내서","x":984,"y":922,"width":50,"height":22},{"text":"방문하고","x":1045,"y":922,"width":69,"height":23},{"text":"인접","x":1124,"y":921,"width":34,"height":23},{"text":"정꼬","x":1169,"y":921,"width":52,"height":23},{"text":"는","x":1233,"y":921,"width":28,"height":21}]},{"text":"이미 류에 들어 추가하지 않는다•","words":[{"text":"이미","x":884,"y":957,"width":33,"height":22},{"text":"류에","x":927,"y":957,"width":34,"height":22},{"text":"들어","x":972,"y":956,"width":33,"height":22},{"text":"추가하지","x":1094,"y":956,"width":70,"height":22},{"text":"않는다•","x":1174,"y":955,"width":63,"height":23}]},{"text":"위의 과정을 큐가 공백 상태가 될 때까지 계속한다. 너비 우선 탐색의 특징은 시작 정점으로부","words":[{"text":"위의","x":185,"y":1089,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"과정을","x":249,"y":1088,"width":84,"height":30},{"text":"큐가","x":342,"y":1088,"width":55,"height":30},{"text":"공백","x":405,"y":1087,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"상태가","x":467,"y":1086,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"될","x":555,"y":1086,"width":24,"height":31},{"text":"때까지","x":590,"y":1086,"width":73,"height":32},{"text":"계속한다.","x":676,"y":1086,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"너비","x":797,"y":1086,"width":47,"height":31},{"text":"우선","x":856,"y":1087,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"탐색의","x":918,"y":1086,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"특징은","x":1006,"y":1086,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"시작","x":1096,"y":1086,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"정점으로부","x":1160,"y":1084,"width":136,"height":32}]},{"text":"터 거리가 가까운 정점의 순서로 탐색을 진행된다는 것이다. 너비우선 탐색은 거리가 d인 정점","words":[{"text":"터","x":154,"y":1140,"width":22,"height":29},{"text":"거리가","x":193,"y":1140,"width":83,"height":30},{"text":"가까운","x":288,"y":1139,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"정점의","x":382,"y":1139,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"순서로","x":471,"y":1139,"width":78,"height":29},{"text":"탐색을","x":560,"y":1138,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"진행된다는","x":648,"y":1138,"width":127,"height":30},{"text":"것이다.","x":787,"y":1138,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"너비우선","x":886,"y":1137,"width":102,"height":31},{"text":"탐색은","x":1001,"y":1138,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"거리가","x":1093,"y":1137,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"d인","x":1184,"y":1136,"width":43,"height":30},{"text":"정점","x":1240,"y":1136,"width":51,"height":30}]},{"text":"들을 모두 방문한 다음, 거리가 (d+1)인 정점들을 모두 방문하게 된다. 즉 거리가 0인 시작 정점","words":[{"text":"들을","x":152,"y":1191,"width":56,"height":29},{"text":"모두","x":218,"y":1193,"width":56,"height":27},{"text":"방문한","x":284,"y":1191,"width":83,"height":29},{"text":"다음,","x":376,"y":1190,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"거리가","x":450,"y":1190,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"(d+1)인","x":538,"y":1190,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"정점들을","x":636,"y":1190,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"모두","x":746,"y":1191,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"방문하게","x":807,"y":1190,"width":102,"height":29},{"text":"된다.","x":921,"y":1189,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"즉","x":992,"y":1191,"width":29,"height":28},{"text":"거리가","x":1032,"y":1189,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"0인","x":1120,"y":1189,"width":42,"height":29},{"text":"시작","x":1174,"y":1188,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"정점","x":1239,"y":1187,"width":52,"height":31}]},{"text":"을 방문한후, 거리가 1인 정점, 거리가 2인 정점, 거리가 3인 정점 등의 순서로 정점들을 방문해","words":[{"text":"을","x":152,"y":1242,"width":28,"height":28},{"text":"방문한후,","x":190,"y":1242,"width":127,"height":30},{"text":"거리가","x":331,"y":1242,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"1인","x":421,"y":1242,"width":37,"height":29},{"text":"정점,","x":469,"y":1242,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"거리가","x":539,"y":1242,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"2인","x":624,"y":1242,"width":39,"height":29},{"text":"정점,","x":674,"y":1241,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"거리가","x":743,"y":1241,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"3인","x":828,"y":1240,"width":39,"height":30},{"text":"정점","x":878,"y":1241,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"등의","x":939,"y":1240,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"순서로","x":1001,"y":1240,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"정점들을","x":1093,"y":1240,"width":108,"height":30},{"text":"방문해","x":1211,"y":1239,"width":80,"height":30}]},{"text":"간다.","words":[{"text":"간다.","x":153,"y":1292,"width":60,"height":30}]},{"text":"너비 우선 탐색의 구현(인접 행렬 버전)","words":[{"text":"너비","x":156,"y":1430,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"우선","x":234,"y":1430,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"탐색의","x":317,"y":1430,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"구현(인접","x":428,"y":1428,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"행렬","x":581,"y":1430,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"버전)","x":656,"y":1427,"width":70,"height":41}]},{"text":"디픱은 인접 행렬을 이용하여 너비 우선 탐색을 구현한 것이다. 너비 우선 탐색은 큐를 사용하여","words":[{"text":"디픱은","x":155,"y":1497,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"인접","x":247,"y":1497,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"행렬을","x":311,"y":1497,"width":81,"height":30},{"text":"이용하여","x":402,"y":1497,"width":101,"height":30},{"text":"너비","x":516,"y":1497,"width":48,"height":30},{"text":"우선","x":576,"y":1496,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"탐색을","x":636,"y":1496,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"구현한","x":720,"y":1496,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"것이다.","x":805,"y":1496,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"너비","x":901,"y":1496,"width":48,"height":30},{"text":"우선","x":962,"y":1496,"width":52,"height":29},{"text":"